[372.861119, "o", "  \u001b[36m●\u001b[0m \u001b[1mSkill\u001b[0m \u001b[2mopticli\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[375.203955, "o", "  \u001b[36m●\u001b[0m \u001b[1mBash\u001b[0m \u001b[2mopticli search \"Alloy Track\" --limit 200; echo; opticli search \"Partners\" --limit 50\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[379.203955, "o", "  \u001b[36m●\u001b[0m \u001b[1mBash\u001b[0m \u001b[2mopticli where-used 1212 --pages; echo; opticli where-used 8 --pages; echo; opticli access 1213; echo; opticli get 1213 --fields n\u001b[2m…\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[383.203955, "o", "  \u001b[36m●\u001b[0m \u001b[1mBash\u001b[0m \u001b[2mopticli get 9 --fields MainContentArea; echo; opticli get 7 --fields MainContentArea; echo; opticli versions 9 --limit 3; echo; o\u001b[2m…\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[387.203955, "o", "  \u001b[36m●\u001b[0m \u001b[1mBash\u001b[0m \u001b[2mopticli access 1216; echo; opticli get 1212 --fields Link,Heading\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[391.203955, "o", "\r\n  Two live pages promote the Alloy Track whitepaper (`/en/alloy-track/download-whitepaper-alloy-track/`):\r\n  \r\n  - **Alloy Track** (`/en/alloy-track/`) shows the Whitepaper page directly, full width, in its main content area.\r\n"]
[391.203994, "o", "  - **Alloy Meet** (`/en/alloy-meet/`) has the new \"Alloy Track whitepaper teaser\" block (\"Plan less, ship more\"), which links to the whitepaper. That version\r\n    went live today at 09:04 UTC.\r\n  \r\n"]
[391.204144, "o", "  The new **Partners** section (`/en/partners/`, also reachable at `/resellers`) can be read by any logged-in user (the Authenticated role). Administrators\r\n  have full access, and anonymous visitors can't see it. Its only child page, Partner training, gets the same rights from Partners.\r\n  \r\n  So any signed-in account can read it, not just partners. If it should be partners only, it needs a dedicated role. I haven't changed anything.\r\n"]
[395.204144, "o", "\u001b[32m\u001b[1m/demo/Alloy\u001b[0m \u001b[36m❯\u001b[0m o"]
